WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:04.025
Welcome to Giramichi — the AI-guided project engine built specifically

00:04.037 --> 00:05.650
for autonomous coding agents.

00:06.512 --> 00:08.875
Unlike traditional project management tools,

00:09.012 --> 00:11.412
Giramichi is completely MCP-native.

00:12.275 --> 00:15.700
Humans never manually drag cards or configure workflows.

00:16.562 --> 00:20.675
Instead, AI agents orchestrate the entire development lifecycle through

00:20.687 --> 00:22.912
standard Model Context Protocol tools,

00:23.150 --> 00:25.350
while teams observe progress in real time on a

00:25.362 --> 00:27.137
clean glassmorphism dashboard.

00:28.100 --> 00:30.700
Whenever an AI agent begins a new objective,

00:30.937 --> 00:33.487
it requests a dedicated session to keep track of

00:33.500 --> 00:34.850
all development within it.

00:35.712 --> 00:38.837
This session acts as an isolated project workspace where

00:38.850 --> 00:40.562
the agent organizes tasks,

00:40.737 --> 00:43.950
logs telemetry, and records its technical decisions.

00:44.812 --> 00:48.562
Under this session, the agent automatically configures custom workflow

00:48.575 --> 00:52.062
stages tailored specifically to the project development pipeline.

00:53.100 --> 00:56.237
As the AI agent breaks down requirements into actionable

00:56.250 --> 01:00.287
steps, it creates structured tasks with precise decimal execution

01:00.300 --> 01:02.775
ordering. As work proceeds,

01:02.887 --> 01:05.962
the agent advances task cards through workflow stages,

01:06.200 --> 01:09.337
documenting its technical rationale for every transition.

01:10.200 --> 01:13.150
Every state update is instantly broadcast to the dashboard

01:13.162 --> 01:16.550
via real-time Server-Sent Events with zero manual intervention.

01:17.600 --> 01:20.862
Giramichi delivers comprehensive execution observability.

01:21.725 --> 01:25.112
With every action, Giramichi monitors token consumption,

01:25.312 --> 01:28.350
calculates live inference costs across models like Claude,

01:28.500 --> 01:33.037
Gemini, and GPT-4, and visualizes sprint velocity and stage

01:33.050 --> 01:37.037
dwell times. Every AI decision and status update is

01:37.050 --> 01:39.662
permanently preserved in the real-time activity stream.

01:40.600 --> 01:44.975
Giramichi unites autonomous AI execution with transparent human oversight,

01:45.150 --> 01:47.050
powered entirely through MCP.

01:47.912 --> 01:49.925
Empower your AI agents to plan,

01:50.087 --> 01:52.937
execute, and deliver with clarity and confidence.
